flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T20:40:01.6153111Z ^[[0m
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T20:40:01.6153897Z This installation tool will set up your computer with the Nix package
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T20:40:01.6154672Z manager. This will happen in a few stages:
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T20:40:01.6155065Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T20:40:01.6155395Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T20:40:01.6156614Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T20:40:01.6157118Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T20:40:01.6157434Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T20:40:01.6158057Z    if you are ready to continue.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T20:40:01.6158352Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T20:40:01.6158929Z 3. Create the system users ^[[34m(uids [30001..30008])^[[0m and groups ^[[34m(gid 30000)^[[0m
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T20:40:01.6159795Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T20:40:01.6160524Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T20:40:01.6160997Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T20:40:01.6161173Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T20:40:01.6161350Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T20:40:01.6161729Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T20:40:01.6161957Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T20:40:01.6162398Z    can use Nix.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T20:40:01.6162544Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T20:40:01.6162643Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T20:40:01.6162817Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T20:40:01.6168651Z ^[[32m^[[4;32mWould you like to see a more detailed list of what I will do?
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T20:40:01.6169412Z ^[[0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T20:40:01.6169634Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T20:40:01.6169721Z I will:
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T20:40:01.6169871Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T20:40:01.6170051Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T20:40:01.6170448Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T20:40:01.6170849Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T20:40:01.6171219Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T20:40:01.6171477Z  - install Nix in /nix
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T20:40:01.6171727Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T20:40:01.6172106Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T20:40:01.6172476Z    /root
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T20:40:01.6182470Z  - back up /etc/bash.bashrc to /etc/bash.bashrc.backup-before-nix
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T20:40:01.6183044Z  - update /etc/bash.bashrc to include some Nix configuration
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T20:40:01.6194788Z  - load and start a service (at /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.service
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T20:40:01.6195334Z    and /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.socket) for nix-daemon
